# Gitignored files that a fresh Claude Code worktree still needs. Same syntax as .gitignore;
# only files that are also gitignored are copied.
#
# Without the Supabase env the app cannot reach its backend, and without the Vercel link
# `vercel` asks which project this is all over again.
.env
.env.local
.env*.local
.claude/settings.local.json
.vercel/**
